    "body": "I merged `origin/main` into the branch. The only conflict was the module list in `crates/post/src/machine/mod.rs`. I kept both lines.\n\nI added the test `an_inverted_axis_with_two_nonzero_ends_flips_both_bounds`. It inverts X (travel -100..200, origin 10) and asserts both bounds of all three axes.\n\nMutation check: I removed the direction sign from the upper bound. The new test failed. The old test still passed. I restored the code.\n\nTests run: `cargo test -p camcraft-post machine::envelope` (5 passed), `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib work_envelope` (3 passed), and clippy with `-D warnings` on post and ui (clean).\n\nProduct code did not change.\n",
